  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Both bones in the lower leg snap, leaving your foot and lower part of the leg dangling. Pieces of shattered bone poke out through the skin.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You gain Prone, @Condition[Stunned] (3) and @Condition[Bleeding] (1). If you receive Surgery within a week it’ll count as a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.2iult41Jehz0F1O8]{Broken Bone (Major)} except you automatically fail any test to avoid long-term effects. Otherwise the leg is permanently useless (see under @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.k00PimCWkff11IA0]{Amputated Parts}). Regardless, you contract a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.kKccDTGzWzSXCBOb]{Festering Wound} due to the open fracture.</p>"
    },
